2026-10-03 20:44:24,806 - aml_osdd_helper - DEBUG - [summary result] [BatchSummary(summary="The content provided is about Deloitte's 'Explore Your Fit' experience, which helps users find job opportunities that match their background and interests. Deloitte collects personal information through the website and mobile apps, such as name, job title, and contact information. This information is used to provide access to the website and mobile apps, customize content, and for marketing purposes. Deloitte may share this information with other members of the Deloitte Network and third parties. The privacy statement also mentions the EU-U.S. and Swiss-U.S. Privacy Shield Frameworks and provides information on how to access and control personal information.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary="The content provided is about Deloitte's 'Explore Your Fit' experience, which helps users find job opportunities that match their background and interests. The privacy statement outlines how Deloitte collects, uses, and discloses personal information. It also addresses information security, children's privacy, and changes to the privacy statement. Deloitte is a global network of member firms with each firm being a legally separate and independent entity.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary="Deloitte's Talent Network offers career resources, potential job opportunities, and insights into life at Deloitte. Joining the network allows you to connect with Deloitte and stay updated on the latest news and opportunities. Deloitte is known for its culture of inclusion, high performance, and opportunity. The company offers a range of continuous learning opportunities and has been recognized for its commitment to sustainability and employee well-being. Deloitte provides industry-leading audit, consulting, tax, and advisory services to clients worldwide. The company is dedicated to driving innovation and helping clients address their most pressing challenges while also giving professionals opportunities to learn and grow. Deloitte has adopted a net-zero greenhouse gas emissions target and is committed to sustainability efforts.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary='Deloitte is a recognized leader of top talent. We strive to be an organization where our people can thrive. With a focus on development, flexibility, and well-being, we hire people who are among the best and brightest in the business. Our culture is about inclusion, collaboration, high performance, and opportunity, and we are proud to be recognized as a great place to work.', key_facts=['Deloitte US-India Offices (USI) is a region within the Deloitte US organization, with offices across seven cities in India–Hyderabad, Mumbai, Delhi/NCR, Bengaluru, Kolkata, Pune, and Chennai.', 'Deloitte is a global organization that is making an impact every day. A workplace where you can immerse yourself in a dynamic culture of inclusion, collaboration, continuous development and high performance—all while being you.', 'Our people are at the core of everything we do. Bringing a wealth of experience and Perspective to the table, it is these people who help solve some of our clients’ and communities’ greatest challenges—who make the real impact that matters.'])]
