2026-10-03 20:58:01,978 - aml_osdd_helper - DEBUG - [summary result] [BatchSummary(summary="Deloitte's headquarters is located at 1 New Street Square, London, Greater London, United Kingdom. The company has multiple office locations worldwide, including Washington, DC, Casablanca, Miyazaki, Malabo, Manama, Hamburg, Qurum, and others. Deloitte offers various services such as audit, tax, and consulting. The organization is committed to driving societal change and promoting environmental sustainability. Deloitte empowers CFOs in private equity-backed companies to drive value and accelerate growth. The company also helps the WNBA build its strategy and infrastructure behind stronger fan connections, richer digital experiences, and lasting value for teams.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary="Deloitte Dallas operates a major office in the Uptown district, supporting clients in technology, healthcare, financial services, and energy. The office offers a modern workspace with flexible areas, collaboration spaces, and technology-enabled rooms for hybrid schedules. Deloitte Dallas careers provide defined growth paths with training and mentorship across consulting, audit, tax, and advisory roles. The office supports early career professionals and experienced hires, with internships offering hands-on project work and opportunities for full-time offers. Deloitte Dallas jobs include consulting, digital, financial advisory, audit, and tax roles at multiple experience levels. The office is competitive in hiring, with candidates evaluated on communication skills, analytical thinking, and leadership potential. Salaries align with the Texas market and vary by role and experience. Deloitte Dallas helps clients with consulting, audit, tax, and advisory services, focusing on digital transformation and strategic problem solving. The office serves key industries such as financial services, technology, healthcare, and energy, relying on Deloitte's analytical, technological, and regulatory expertise. Deloitte University, located near Dallas, offers professional development programs for Deloitte professionals, including training in teamwork, problem solving, and client communication.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary="Deloitte Consulting is a leading Management Consulting firm headquartered in New York, NY. The firm's headquarters is located at 30 Rockefeller Plaza, New York, NY 10112. Deloitte Consulting provides comprehensive professional services to clients across diverse industries. The headquarters houses key functions and practice groups, including client service teams, industry groups, support functions, and knowledge management. The firm fosters a culture of excellence, integrity, and client service, with a focus on professional development, diversity and inclusion, and quality in client engagements. The New York headquarters serves as the foundation of the firm's operations, designed to support growing client needs and evolving market opportunities.", key_facts=[]), BatchSummary(summary='Deloitte & Touche LLP is a professional services firm that offers audit, tax, consulting, and financial advisory services. The firm is registered with the US Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) and is a member of the American Institute of Certified Public Accountants (AICPA) and the Public Company Accounting Oversight Board (PCAOB). Deloitte & Touche LLP has offices in various locations across the United States, including New York, Los Angeles, Chicago, and San Francisco. The firm provides a wide range of services to clients across various industries, including financial services, healthcare, technology, media, and telecommunications. Deloitte & Touche LLP is committed to delivering high-quality services and maintaining the highest standards of integrity and professionalism.', key_facts=[])]
